: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">여권을 먼저 발급받기 바라며</font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">(구미시청에 문의)</span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffe400\" color=\"#000000\">★여권 사본과 통장사본을 제출하시기 바랍니다.</font></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffe400\" color=\"#000000\">★ (12월 5일(월), 오후 4시까지)</font></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffe400\" color=\"#000000\">(제출방법: 직접제출 또는 메일로 제출)</font></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">세부 오리엔테이션 일정 안내는 학교 홈페이지 공지사항 및 개별문자연락으로 안내하도록 하겠습니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">국제교류교육원 행정실 테크노관 458호</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">김민아&nbsp;☎ 054-478-7216 / <a href=\"mailto:minah@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">minah@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></a